#   b "So your presence is only bound to make things worse if they come in here and see us together."
    b "Portanto, sua presença só irá piorar as coisas se eles entrarem aqui e nos virem juntos."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:316
