    mc "Relaxa... eu estava disfarçado, lembra?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:318
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_09895d88:

#   b "Yeah, but I wasn’t."
    b "Sim, mas eu não estava."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:319
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_417b0bd1:

#   b "And if they’ve figured out that I wasn’t a real waitress, then I could be totally screwed."
    b "E se eles descobrirem que eu não era uma garçonete de verdade, então posso estar completamente ferrada."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:321
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_006cc220:

#   b "So scram before I have to kick your ass out of here myself."
    b "Então vaza daqui antes que eu mesmo tenha que te expulsar daqui a pontapés."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:323
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_fe7cb983:

#   mc "Look, I just need a few minutes of your time and then I’m gone."
    mc "Olha, eu só preciso de alguns minutos do seu tempo e já vou embora."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:325
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_9c7c6c90:

#   mc "Besides, [mc_vic_address] wants us to discuss the tattoo parlours in town after you finish your shift."
    mc "Além do mais, [mc_vic_address] quer que falemos sobre os estúdios de tatuagem da cidade depois que você terminar o seu turno."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:327
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_1e6e8c0b:

#   mc "And I really want to be part of this big job he has in the works so I {b}have{/b} to get that flash drive back."
    mc "E eu realmente quero fazer parte desse grande projeto que ele está desenvolvendo, então eu {b} ter{/b} para recuperar aquele pen drive."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:329
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_813627c8:

#   b "Ugh... Fine."
    b "Ah... Tudo bem."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:331
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_bad625e6:

#   b "But know this... I’m only helping you because he asked me to."
    b "Mas saiba disto... só estou te ajudando porque ele me pediu."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:332
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_f13d3e18:

#   b "And I also don’t want to get in any more trouble with him."
    b "E eu também não quero me meter em mais problemas com ele."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:334
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_7a8a3b39:

#   mc "Works for me."
    mc "Para mim, funciona."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:339
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_7f1aabdb:

#   b "Okay, so I looked at the tattoo design you drew up last night."
    b "Ok, então eu dei uma olhada no desenho da tatuagem que você fez ontem à noite."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:340
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_76ce6008:

#   b "I made a call to one place, and sent an email to the other and managed to rule out both as possibilities."
    b "Liguei para um lugar e enviei um e-mail para o outro, conseguindo descartar ambas as possibilidades."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:342
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_38a6e8c9:

#   b "But the third parlour... Well, it looks like that the girl at the party could have had her tattoo done there."
    b "Mas o terceiro estúdio... Bem, parece que a garota da festa pode ter feito a tatuagem lá."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:344
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_0840c543:

#   b "Or at the very least, the artist should be able to tell us where it came from or where she was inked."
    b "Ou, no mínimo, a artista deveria ser capaz de nos dizer de onde veio a tatuagem ou onde ela foi feita."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:346
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_f3a5c9ba:

#   b "And maybe even what the meaning of it."
    b "E talvez até mesmo qual seja o significado disso."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:351
