#   mc "Hmm..."
    mc "Hum..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:391
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_0d9ffea6:

#   mc "Well, this is an interesting painting. Very eye-catching."
    mc "Bem, esta é uma pintura interessante. Muito chamativa."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:393
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_9af7fe8b:

#   b "I thought you’d like it, you little perv."
    b "Achei que você ia gostar, seu pervertidozinho."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:395
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_83d77586:

#   mc "Guilty as charged."
    mc "Culpado conforme a acusação."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:397
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_3c003ffc:

#   mc "This looks like it could be quite complicated to forge, even for you."
    mc "Parece que isso seria bem complicado de falsificar, mesmo para você."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:398
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_6933111d:

#   mc "Especially when taking a closer look at the color changes over time and some surface cracking."
    mc "Principalmente ao observar mais atentamente as mudanças de cor ao longo do tempo e algumas rachaduras superficiais."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:400
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_7fa6afab:

#   b "You’re right, though the main obstacle for me is finding the right paints and brushes I need to make it look authentic."
    b "Você tem razão, embora o principal obstáculo para mim seja encontrar as tintas e os pincéis certos para que fique com uma aparência autêntica."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:401
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_4f287633:

#   b "And he hasn’t given me much time to get it done."
    b "E ele não me deu muito tempo para terminar."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:403
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_d2593457:

#   b "The things I need are very expensive. After extensive research, there are only a few art schools in town that could have the right tools for me to make the replica."
    b "Os materiais que preciso são muito caros. Após uma extensa pesquisa, descobri que apenas algumas escolas de arte na cidade possuem as ferramentas adequadas para que eu possa fazer a réplica."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:405
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_2dc8dc24:

#   mc "Do you know which schools?"
    mc "Você sabe quais escolas?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:407
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_3bd64dd6:

#   b "Yeah, they’re all located in the rich area of town where security is much tighter and harder to get around."
    b "Sim, todos eles estão localizados na área nobre da cidade, onde a segurança é muito mais rigorosa e é mais difícil se locomover."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:417
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_01684483:

#   b "Look, working with you goes against every fibre of my being."
    b "Olha, trabalhar com você vai contra todos os meus princípios."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:419
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_acd205c4:

#   b "But this is important to [vic_mc_rel], so it’s important to me. And it would also be for the good of the [private_group], of course."
    b "Mas isto é importante para [vic_mc_rel] Portanto, é importante para mim. E também seria para o bem do [private_group], claro."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:422
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_dd9d1ade:

#   b "I want you to help me get these things, [y_name]. I mean you do owe me, considering I’m helping you to find this tattoo parlour and the girl who has the flash drive."
    b "Quero que você me ajude a conseguir essas coisas. [y_name] Quer dizer, você me deve uma, considerando que estou te ajudando a encontrar esse estúdio de tatuagem e a garota que tem o pen drive."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:425
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_4a6b66a0:

#   mc "(Damn, she’s right.)"
    mc "(Droga, ela tem razão.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:428
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_611e837a:

#   mc "Well, if it’s for the good of the [private_group], then fine, I’ll help you."
    mc "Bem, se for para o bem do [private_group] Então tudo bem, eu te ajudo."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:431
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_c8fd58e2:

#   b "Cool."
    b "Legal."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:436
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_ce3fa2ad:

#   mc "(I could offer to help her, but I'd rather stew over this for a bit longer.)"
    mc "(Eu poderia me oferecer para ajudá-la, mas prefiro refletir sobre isso por mais um tempo.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:438
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_57fa4377:

#   mc "(And I don't want [b_name] to think I'm a sucker for helping her.)"
    mc "(E eu não quero) [b_name] Pensar que sou um otário por ajudá-la.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:440
translate brazil lb_ep01_04_01_Bella_Work_1_5cadd268:

#   mc "(Even though I'm intrigued by the task.)"
    mc "(Apesar de a tarefa me intrigar.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/04_01_The_MC_Visits_Bella_at_Work.rpy:453
